1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,833
Markets talk all day. Most of it is noise.

2
00:00:03,833 --> 00:00:09,519
AI MarketPulse reads RSS, email, Telegram, Reddit and SEC filings into one scored queue.

3
00:00:09,519 --> 00:00:15,204
The AI turns each item into a structured signal, and shows why it fired.

4
00:00:15,204 --> 00:00:19,778
TradeOS runs research and a bull-versus-bear debate before reaching a verdict.

5
00:00:19,778 --> 00:00:24,722
Then seventeen deterministic pre-trade checks decide. Overrides can't bypass the risk core.

6
00:00:24,722 --> 00:00:29,667
Loss limits, drawdown caps, and a kill switch you can actually reach.

7
00:00:29,667 --> 00:00:34,611
Everything starts on paper. Going live means meeting a published five-step ladder.

8
00:00:34,611 --> 00:00:38,815
Every decision carries one trace ID, from headline to order.

9
00:00:38,815 --> 00:00:42,278
The AI interprets. Code decides. Everything is logged.

10
00:00:42,278 --> 00:00:46,141
Paper-trading simulation. Not financial advice. Educational use only.
